{
  "about": "The SMS counter's cases, read by both counters (internal/smsrender and src/utils/smsParts.ts). A text is its pieces, each a string repeated a number of times. The expected figures are worked out by hand: GSM-7 is 160 characters in one part or 153 per part, UCS-2 70 or 67; one character outside GSM-7 makes the whole text UCS-2; a GSM-7 extension character counts as two, and UCS-2 counts UTF-16 code units. The limit is the longest text the SMS provider sends (Twilio: 1,600 characters in GSM-7, 700 in UCS-2, counted as the counter counts them), and each limit case says whether its text fits it.",
